title: Generate GetWeight implementations for XCM instructions

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The `XcmWeightInfoTrait` derive now generates the `GetWeight` implementation alongside the
      `XcmWeightInfo` trait. XCM v3, v4, and v5 no longer maintain separate handwritten dispatch
      matches, so instruction changes update the weight interface and dispatch from one source.

crates:
  - name: xcm-procedural
    bump: minor
  - name: staging-xcm
    bump: minor
